  "description": "A static site and automation suite for the 'This Week in Rust' community newsletter. It leverages the Pelican static site generator to manage over a decade of Markdown-based archival content and active drafts. The repository includes Python tools for automating event discovery via GraphQL, validating external links, and streamlining the publication workflow for editors.",
